From 728212ab11496abc2b169e38bea965b906a56b19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jira White <jira.white@icahn.mssm.edu>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:56:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Monthly segments: monthly timing, monthly diag_table, tgrad
 tests monthly

- fv3_namelists.common_configs: for months/years set fdiag = fhzero = 6 h,
  fhswr = fhlwr = 3600 s, ldiag3d and fprint off, print_freq 24 h (Ai2/GFDL
  SHiELD C96 climate runs, ai2cm/ace2-som-paper)
- monthly, tgrad_ctrl, tgrad_sst4 tests: dt_atmos 600, dt_ocean 600,
  k_split 2, n_split 6, 3 nodes x 48 = 144 tasks; monthly test uses configs/diag_table.monthly
- diag_table.monthly: prsn; runoff bucket totals summed (mrro_sum, mrros_sum)
- input templates: print_freq 1 h (was every 6 steps)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012n9byGBDR7KgtB6m8RLTeN
