+# C96 month segments: dt_atmos 600 s, k_split 2, n_split 6 (remap 300 s,
+# acoustic 50 s). 600 s keeps dt_atmos <= fv_sg_adj (600 s), as in every GFDL
+# SHiELD_build RTS (fv_sg_SHiELD relaxes by dt_atmos/fv_sg_adj without a cap),
+# and divides the 6 h fdiag/fhzero and the 1 h radiation interval.
+dt_atmos: 600
+dt_ocean: 600
